```

Restart becomes atomic and local-state based:

```ts
await closeProjectionChannels(projection.origin, channelClosed);
await stopProjectionFixture(projection);

projection = await startService(
  ["bun", "run", "tests/e2e/topology-projection-fixture.ts"],
  "topology-projection-fixture",
  { ...process.env, TOPOLOGY_PROJECTION_PORT: "0" },
);

const proxyUpdates = await Promise.all([
  fetch(`${stage.origin}/__test/gateway`, {
    method: "POST",
    body: JSON.stringify({ origin: projection.origin }),
  }),
  fetch(`${consoleService.origin}/__test/backend`, {
    method: "POST",
    body: JSON.stringify({ origin: projection.origin }),
  }),
]);
```

`availablePort()`, `createNetServer`, and all module-level mutable port/origin variables can then be removed.

